abstract: "Daily technical buy-signal screener for 60 large-cap stocks across
  6 sectors (SMA-50/200 + RSI-14), including a confirmed 2-close 200-day
  reclaim rule, quality-dip entry criteria, and a 3-year backtest methodology.
  Pure Python, zero dependencies."
